        "kicker": "MADE FRESH DAILY",
        "heading": "OUR FIRST LOCATION. NOW EXPRESS.",
        "text": "<p>From a food truck with lines of taco lovers to our first restaurant in Boca, this is where Taco Labs took root. Your support helped us grow into Taco Labs Kitchen &amp; Bar in Parkland. Today, our original Boca restaurant is Taco Labs Express: a smaller footprint with counter service, fresh tacos and margaritas, built for quick bites or takeout.</p><p>Twenty globally inspired tacos, made from scratch daily with high-quality meats, mostly organic ingredients, minimal seed oils and no palm oil. Easy parking right out front.</p>",
